  "workflowCode": "COPY_SALES_ORDER_DSPREP",
  "name": "Copy Sales Order DSPREP",
  "description": "An AI assistant that helps end users to create orders by copying from, and modifying, existing orders. First using the GetUserSession to get date information, then GetSalesOrderDetails tool to get order details based on the order number, then using the GetSalesOrderLinesDetail tool to get order line details using HeaderId. Then, create a new order and lines using Create Order Header and Lines, finally submitting with SubmitOrder and providing a deep link to the order(s) via Sales Order Deep Link.",
